# The in-browser ExtendDB WebAssembly adapter is a third-party, drop-in
# dependency of the browser edition only (D-P6f-8). ddbsh NEVER ships or commits
# the adapter blob: the build stages only ddbsh's own files, and the dev tooling
# (devtools/stage-extenddb-webasm) or the user/deploy drops the adapter files
# into this directory (or the served webroot's vendor/extenddb/). Keep those
# dropped-in files out of git so a local dev stage is never committed by
# accident. Only this .gitignore and PROVENANCE.md are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!PROVENANCE.md
